        "row_description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": true,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "The full story",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "icon": "lipstick",
            "content": "<p>Meet the brush that does what hot tools can&rsquo;t. The Glow Beauty <strong>Smoothing Brush</strong> is handcrafted with a signature mix of <strong>100% natural boar bristle</strong> and <strong>clear nylon bristles</strong> — a combination stylists swear by for one simple reason: it works.</p><p>The natural boar bristles gently carry the oils from your scalp down the length of every strand, conditioning your hair and sealing the cuticle for instant, mirror-like shine. The clear nylon bristles reach deeper to tame frizz, smooth flyaways and add the perfect amount of tension for a polished, salon-smooth finish.</p><p>The result? Sleek, shiny, healthy-looking hair — without a single degree of heat. Every brush arrives with a <strong>complimentary dust bag</strong> to keep it pristine at home or on the go. And because boar bristle is a natural material, slight variations make each brush beautifully one-of-a-kind.</p>"
          }
        },
        "row_how": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "How to use",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "icon": "stopwatch",
            "content": "<p><strong>1. Start smooth.</strong> Use on dry or damp, detangled hair.</p><p><strong>2. Brush root to tip.</strong> Glide slowly from your scalp to your ends, letting the boar bristles distribute your natural oils.</p><p><strong>3. Polish &amp; set.</strong> Finish with a final pass over the top layer for that signature glass-hair shine.</p><p><strong>4. Store it right.</strong> Tuck your brush into its complimentary dust bag between uses.</p>"
          }
        },
        "row_materials": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "Materials & care",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><strong>Bristles:</strong> 100% natural boar bristle + clear nylon.</p><p><strong>Handle:</strong> Smooth, ergonomic and hand-finished.</p><p><strong>Includes:</strong> One Smoothing Brush + complimentary dust bag.</p><p><strong>Care:</strong> Remove hair after each use. Occasionally clean the bristles with a drop of gentle shampoo and lukewarm water, then lay flat to air dry. Avoid soaking the cushion base.</p><p><em>Because boar bristle is a natural product, slight variation between brushes is normal — and a mark of authentic quality.</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "row_shipping": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "Shipping & returns",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "icon": "moving-truck",
            "content": "<p><strong>Free shipping</strong> on all US orders over $50. Most orders ship within 1–2 business days, carbon neutral.</p><p><strong>30-day money-back guarantee.</strong> If you&rsquo;re not obsessed with your shine, return it within 30 days for a full refund.</p><p><strong>Free returns &amp; exchanges.</strong> Email us and we&rsquo;ll send a prepaid label — no hassle, ever.</p>"
          }
