        "q1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Will it work on my hair type?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The Smoothing Brush is designed for all hair types and lengths. For very thick or curly hair, detangle first, then smooth in sections.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Is boar bristle good for my hair?",
            "text": "<p>Boar bristle is a stylist favorite because it distributes your scalp&rsquo;s natural oils down the hair shaft — conditioning strands and adding shine without product. Our blend pairs it with clear nylon to smooth frizz and add gentle grip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I use it on wet hair?",
            "text": "<p>It works best on dry or damp, detangled hair. For wet detangling, start with our Detangling Brush, then finish with the Smoothing Brush for shine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How is this different from the Detangling Brush?",
            "text": "<p>The Detangling Brush glides through knots on wet hair. The Smoothing Brush is your finishing tool — it polishes, smooths frizz and adds shine. Most people love using them together.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I clean it?",
            "text": "<p>Remove hair after each use. Occasionally clean the bristles with a drop of gentle shampoo and lukewarm water, then lay flat to dry. Avoid soaking the base.</p>"
          }
        },
